   "widgets_values": [
    "HaDeS MOSS Suite - Production Poster (advanced)\n\nA poster with three texts from boxes to a checked 2048 x 3072 file, on HaDeS MOSS v1.0 Turbo (8 steps, CFG 1).\n\n1. Layout: the boxes are on the Layout Editor's canvas (title, badge, bottom line, the fiddler, the lighthouse).\n   Edit them there, or unmute the Prompt Enhancer (right-click > Mode > Always), write your idea and press\n   DRAFT LAYOUT for new boxes.\n2. Candidates: the Layout Compiler's batch_size 4 gives four seeds in one run (Preview: candidates).\n3. MOSS Text Check reads every candidate and best_image passes on the one with the most texts exact.\n   Its report has a line per candidate saying which text failed.\n4. x2: RealESRGAN x2, then a MOSS pass at denoise 0.25 with the same model, prompt and seed.\n5. A second Text Check reads the final image, and the Image Saver keeps the whole pipeline in the PNG.\n\nMeasured (3 seeds, RTX 5090, tools/RESULTS.md): 3 of the 12 candidates had all three texts exact;\nseeds 1013 and 1015 gave one, seed 1014 none (then the closest is passed on and passed is false: change the seed).\nEvery text was spelled right on all 12: the failures were the title breaking into two lines below its box.\nThe check holds the image to your boxes; a taller title box is how you allow two lines.\nThe x2 pass kept every verdict on all three seeds. About 50-60 s a run; the x2 stage with both checks about 33 s;\nthe final check alone 2-3 s.\n\nModels: HaDeS MOSS v1.0 Turbo in models/diffusion_models, RealESRGAN_x2plus.pth in models/upscale_models."
   ],
   "properties": {}
  }
